### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@contentType = application/json
@accessToken = {{$dotenv ACCESS_TOKEN}}

# Partial token received when logging in with 2FA enabled
# Copy from login response when twoFactorRequired: true
@twoFactorPendingToken = {{$dotenv TWO_FACTOR_PENDING_TOKEN}}

### ===========================================
### Two-Factor Authentication Setup
### ===========================================

### 1. Initialize 2FA setup
# Returns QR code and secret. Scan QR with authenticator app.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/2fa/setup
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2. Verify setup and activate 2FA
# Enter 6-digit code from authenticator app
# IMPORTANT: Save the backup codes returned - they're shown only once!
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/2fa/verify-setup
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "code": "123456"
}

### ===========================================
### Two-Factor Login Verification
### ===========================================

### Verify 2FA during login
# Use the partial token from login response (when twoFactorRequired: true)
# Can use TOTP code or backup code
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/2fa/verify
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{twoFactorPendingToken}}

{
  "code": "123456"
}

### ===========================================
### Backup Codes Management
### ===========================================

### Get remaining backup codes count
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/2fa/backup-codes
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Regenerate backup codes
# Requires current TOTP code (not backup code)
# Old backup codes are invalidated
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/2fa/backup-codes/regenerate
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "code": "123456"
}

### ===========================================
### Disable 2FA
### ===========================================

### Disable 2FA
# Requires password AND either TOTP code or backup code
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/2fa/disable
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "password": "SecurePass12345678",
  "code": "123456"
}
